    <briefdescription>
<para>Process-wide cache of the database schema used by the validators. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The single static <ref refid="classDatabaseSchema_1a607a79c489b46a2d8b1d72f40dcfd272" kindref="member">databaseSchema</ref> map is populated at construction by querying <ref refid="classDatabaseController" kindref="compound">DatabaseController</ref> for every table and its columns, and is thereafter read-only. The object is created eagerly by <ref refid="classServer" kindref="compound">Server</ref>&apos;s constructor and owned by <ref refid="classStore" kindref="compound">Store</ref>, so the schema is available before any request validation runs. Copy construction/assignment are allowed but share the same static state; move operations are explicitly disabled.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Because the schema is a startup snapshot, schema changes made externally while the server is running are not reflected until restart. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="warning"><para>Construction terminates the process (or throws) when no tables/columns can be read, so a reachable database is a startup prerequisite. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classValidator" kindref="compound">Validator</ref>, <ref refid="classDatabaseController" kindref="compound">DatabaseController</ref>, <ref refid="classStore" kindref="compound">Store</ref>, <ref refid="databaseschema_8hpp_1aea29cf503a423c2163e5b08142700952" kindref="member">SCHEMA_t</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
